7. Modem
Full Form

MOdulator DEModulator

Definition

A Modem connects your home network to your Internet Service Provider (ISP).

Work

Converts signals so data can travel over the ISP's communication line.

Example
ISP

↓

Modem

↓

Router

↓

Laptop
Real-Life Example

Without a modem,

your router cannot access the Internet from your ISP connection.

Interview Answer

A Modem connects a user's network to the ISP by converting signals suitable for transmission.

Important Points

✔ Connects ISP

✔ Internet Connection




























